	We notice that $[\eta([\tilde{\chi}_{\sigma,\eta}|D_{\sigma},\hat{z}_{\sigma},\hat{t}_{\sigma}|w])]=B \in \mathbb{H}^2(\Gamma_k, C_X^d)$, and 
